=== ANSWER Y ===
The square root of 1,764 is **42**.

Check: 42 × 42 = 1,764. (40² = 1,600, plus 2·40·2 = 160, plus 2² = 4, which gives 1,764.)

The negative number −42 also squares to 1,764. The principal (positive) square root, which is what √ means, is 42.

Confidence: high

